{"5361480":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Doodle Duel","steam_appid":5361480,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRAW YOUR FIGHTER. DUEL YOUR WAY.<\/h2><br>Doodle Duel is a hand-drawn 2D action RPG about turning rough sketches into brave warriors. Draw a fighter, give them a color and a style, then send them into duels against strange bosses and rival drawings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR MARK<\/h2><br>Start with a blank canvas. Every line becomes part of a living warrior, and every color shapes their elemental affinity. Draw weapons, armor, charms and skills by hand, then refine your creations in the workshop.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD, EQUIP, BATTLE<\/h2><br>Climb the arena tower through carefully staged fights. Read enemy patterns, switch warriors, and match colors to exploit elemental strengths. Victories unlock pigments, materials, recipes and new ways to customize your team.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Draw warriors from scratch and validate their battle-ready silhouettes<br><\/li><li>Create hand-drawn weapons, armor, headwear and skills<br><\/li><li>Fight fixed bosses with readable patterns and animated hand-drawn gear<br><\/li><li>Manage eight elemental colors, equipment slots and skill loadouts<br><\/li><li>Climb a tower with manual battles or optional auto-battle<br><\/li><li>Challenge asynchronous player teams when online services are available<br><\/li><li>Play the core campaign offline with your saved drawings<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRAW YOUR FIGHTER. DUEL YOUR WAY.<\/h2><br>Doodle Duel is a hand-drawn 2D action RPG about turning rough sketches into brave warriors. Draw a fighter, give them a color and a style, then send them into duels against strange bosses and rival drawings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR MARK<\/h2><br>Start with a blank canvas. Every line becomes part of a living warrior, and every color shapes their elemental affinity. Draw weapons, armor, charms and skills by hand, then refine your creations in the workshop.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD, EQUIP, BATTLE<\/h2><br>Climb the arena tower through carefully staged fights. Read enemy patterns, switch warriors, and match colors to exploit elemental strengths. Victories unlock pigments, materials, recipes and new ways to customize your team.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Draw warriors from scratch and validate their battle-ready silhouettes<br><\/li><li>Create hand-drawn weapons, armor, headwear and skills<br><\/li><li>Fight fixed bosses with readable patterns and animated hand-drawn gear<br><\/li><li>Manage eight elemental colors, equipment slots and skill loadouts<br><\/li><li>Climb a tower with manual battles or optional auto-battle<br><\/li><li>Challenge asynchronous player teams when online services are available<br><\/li><li>Play the core campaign offline with your saved drawings<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Turn quick sketches into brave warriors in a hand-drawn 2D action RPG. Draw fighters, weapons, armor and skills, match elemental colors, defeat patterned bosses, and climb an arena tower with a team that is uniquely yours. Contact the developer: fluvilume@163.com","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5361480\/90e6e7c149c16b7634ccb73764a26059d9d0b9bf\/header.jpg?t=1793734396","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5361480\/af9c23efc4fec6d0124af6927afe02862edff29d\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793734396","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5361480\/af9c23efc4fec6d0124af6927afe02862edff29d\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793734396","website":"https:\/\/game.appqqa.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x64 CPU with SSE2 support (Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DX11-capable GPU with 1 GB VRAM (Intel HD 5000 \/ NVIDIA GTX 750 \/ AMD R7 260 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Launch Doodle Duel, click Settings in the top-right corner, click Language, and select a locale. The interface refreshes immediately and the selection is saved locally. Current build interface languages: English, French, Italian, German, Spanish (Spain), Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese-Brazil, and Korean.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DX11-capable GPU with 2 GB VRAM (NVIDIA GTX 1060 \/ AMD RX 580 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12.0 Monterey or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel x86_64 or Apple Silicon (universal binary)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal-capable GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1024 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> CoreAudio-compatible sound output<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Native Intel and Apple Silicon build; broadband connection required for online features.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12.0 Monterey or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 or Apple M1 and newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8192 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal-capable GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2048 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> CoreAudio-compatible sound output<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Native Intel and Apple Silicon build; broadband connection required for online features.<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Fluvilume"],"publishers":["Fluvilume"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":399,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$4.99","final_formatted":"$3.99"},"packages":[1851967],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Doodle Duel","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1851967,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Doodle Duel - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99<\/span> $3.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":399}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"